  "description": "Hyper Bicycles has put together the perfect kit for building the most epic 18in Hyper/SNAFU BMX ride the world has seen!\n\nWe have included the awesome 18in Hyper Wizard \"Jet Fuel\" BMX frame built with 100% chromoly tubing along with everything you need and nothing you don't.\n\nWe've also included the SNAFU Magical bars, a two piece handlebar constructed from 4130 heat-treated chromoly with a 20mm crossbar that tapers to 15mm in the center to help save weight in all the right areas without sacrificing strength.\n\nLastly we've included the SNAFU Magical Fork constructed from heat-treated chromoly for maximum strength featuring a 1-piece machined and reinforced steerer tube with integrated bearing race, alloy compression cap, tapered fork legs that are notched for peg clearance and 5mm thick solid dropouts to prevent bending.",
